# gap_7d.vlog: a closed tab for a week (docs/TESTING.md "7-day gap"). A freshly hatched baby
# left alone evolves at 1 h and then dies of neglect within the day; a single update seven days
# later must fast-forward through all of that to the tombstone, and a second update a year
# after that must be an O(1) no-op on a dead pet (docs/STATE_MODEL.md "Fast-forward").

reset 1700000000000 seed=77
t 1700000301000 -
snap hatched

skip 604800000              ; 7 days
t 1700605101000 -
snap dead_after_7_days

skip 31536000000            ; 365 days more
t 1732141101000 -
snap still_dead_a_year_later

t 1732141101100 A           ; a plain press does nothing on a tombstone
t 1732141101200 -
snap buttons_ignored
